{"description": "Pixel art TV home shopping broadcast frame, a 2000s CRT TV shot, 4:3, PACKED WITH DETAIL, no empty wall. MEDIUM SHOT of the show host on the left, head to hands, face about 60 pixels wide, behind a glossy red podium with a chrome edge, both hands resting on its top edge, facing the camera. Black suit, white shirt, dark red tie, combed black hair, unnaturally white made-up face, huge eyes completely black with no whites, thin closed-lip smile, no teeth. Far left edge: a tall live chat monitor of scrolling grey lines, a pile of ribboned gift boxes and shipping boxes below it. Behind the host: two cue light boxes up top with clap and smile icons, a channel logo plate, no letters. Between the podium and the table on the floor: a red Korean street mailbox with an upside-down dried-blood cross. Right half: a large flat wall-mounted studio screen showing a glowing order graphic of rising bars, below it a waist-high demo table with a white cloth, its top bare and empty; at the far right a prop shelf of product boxes. Behind everything: glossy red and black lacquer set panels with gold trim, a black light truss with spotlights along the top, a sales board of red digits in the upper right. LIGHT: bright key light on his face and the table top, pink and cyan rim light, deep black shadows. Dense, highly detailed pixel art, crisp pixel clusters, no dithering, no blur. No letters, no words, no other people.", "image_size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "no_background": false, "reference_images": [{"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "usage_description": "LAYOUT AND SIZE: copy where things are and how big they are from this line drawing: the host from head to hands on the left, his face this big, hands on the podium top, the chat monitor at the far left, cue lights above, the order screen and the empty demo table on the right, the shelf at the far right, the mailbox between podium and table. Do not copy the white color or the black lines."}, {"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 390, "height": 105}, "usage_description": "PIXEL SCALE: these product icons will be placed on the demo table at exactly this pixel size. Match their pixel density, outline thickness and shading. Do not draw these objects."}]}